    "html": "<article class=\"blog-article\">\n <header class=\"article-header\">\n <h1>Exploring the Wonders of the Ocean</h1>\n <div class=\"article-meta\">\n <span class=\"author\">By Emily Johnson</span>\n <time datetime=\"2023-09-05\">September 5, 2023</time>\n </div>\n </header>\n <figure class=\"article-image\">\n <img src=\"ocean.jpg\" alt=\"A breathtaking view of the ocean\" />\n <figcaption>Figure 1: The serene beauty of the ocean at sunset.</figcaption>\n </figure>\n <div class=\"article-content\">\n <p>The ocean covers over 70% of our planet, yet much of it remains unexplored. In this article, we delve into the mysteries and beauty of the ocean, from its vibrant coral reefs to the deep sea trenches.</p>\n <p>The ocean is home to a diversity of life forms, each playing a crucial role in the marine ecosystem. Understanding these organisms helps us appreciate the complexity of life beneath the waves.</p>\n <div class=\"video-container\">\n <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/samplevideourl\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n <p>Video 1: A documentary on marine life and its importance to the Earth's environment.</p>\n </div>\n </div>\n <footer class=\"article-footer\">\n <p>For more articles like this, explore our <a href=\"/ocean-articles\">Ocean Articles</a> page.</p>\n </footer>\n</article>\n<style>\n .blog-article { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px; }\n .article-header { border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n .article-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 10px 0; }\n .video-container { margin-top: 20px; }\n .article-footer { border-top: 2px solid #ddd; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 10px; }\n</style>",
